{"id":"65c566cb4ae1f92f","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-similarity.md","title":"Similarity","display":"df-similarity — Similarity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-similarity","aliases":["58-df-similarity"],"display":"df-similarity — Similarity","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-similarity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-similarity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-similarity — Similarity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb K,V,+_V,\\odot_V\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb K,V,+_V,\\odot_V\\in V\\)</span> (field, carrier, and designated vector-space operations)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,P,Q:V\\to V\">\\(A,B,P,Q:V\\to V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\\)</span> (fully explicit linear-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearAutomorphism}_{\\mathbb K,S},\\mathrm{Similar}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearAutomorphism}_{\\mathbb K,S},\\mathrm{Similar}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}similarity\\text{-}automorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{LinearAutomorphism}_{\\mathbb K,S}(P,V)\\leftrightarrow \\exists +_V,\\odot_V,Q\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(P,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(Q,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land Q\\circ P=\\operatorname{id}_V\\land P\\circ Q=\\operatorname{id}_V\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}similarity\\text{-}automorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{LinearAutomorphism}_{\\mathbb K,S}(P,V)\\leftrightarrow \\exists +_V,\\odot_V,Q\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(P,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(Q,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land Q\\circ P=\\operatorname{id}_V\\land P\\circ Q=\\operatorname{id}_V\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}similarity} \\vdash \\mathrm{Similar}_S(A,B,V,\\mathbb K)\\leftrightarrow \\exists +_V,\\odot_V,P,Q\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(A,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(B,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(P,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(Q,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land Q\\circ P=\\operatorname{id}_V\\land P\\circ Q=\\operatorname{id}_V\\land B=Q\\circ A\\circ P\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}similarity} \\vdash \\mathrm{Similar}_S(A,B,V,\\mathbb K)\\leftrightarrow \\exists +_V,\\odot_V,P,Q\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(A,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(B,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(P,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(Q,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land Q\\circ P=\\operatorname{id}_V\\land P\\circ Q=\\operatorname{id}_V\\land B=Q\\circ A\\circ P\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier space and scalar field are parameters; without them, invertibility and linearity are not determined.</li>\n<li>All four endomorphisms are required to use the same explicitly quantified addition and scalar multiplication on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S$ (fully explicit linear-map predicate, see [[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb K,V,+_V,\\odot_V\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A,B,P,Q:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearAutomorphism}_{\\mathbb K,S},\\mathrm{Similar}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}similarity\\text{-}automorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{LinearAutomorphism}_{\\mathbb K,S}(P,V)\\leftrightarrow \\exists +_V,\\odot_V,Q\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(P,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(Q,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land Q\\circ P=\\operatorname{id}_V\\land P\\circ Q=\\operatorname{id}_V\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}similarity} \\vdash \\mathrm{Similar}_S(A,B,V,\\mathbb K)\\leftrightarrow \\exists +_V,\\odot_V,P,Q\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(A,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(B,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(P,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(Q,V,V,\\mathbb K,+_V,\\odot_V,+_V,\\odot_V)\\land Q\\circ P=\\operatorname{id}_V\\land P\\circ Q=\\operatorname{id}_V\\land B=Q\\circ A\\circ P\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1674,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1166","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-similarity.md|58-df-similarity]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["f67456d74b418241"]}